{"id":"fdc9f29c49f2cdf0","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-mostowski-induction.md","title":"Mostowski Induction","display":"thm-mostowski-induction — Mostowski Induction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-mostowski-induction","aliases":["58-thm-mostowski-induction"],"display":"thm-mostowski-induction — Mostowski Induction","depends_on":["[[58-df-wellfounded]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-mostowski-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-mostowski-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mostowski-induction — Mostowski Induction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A\\in V\">\\(R,A\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(P:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(x)\">\\(P(x)\\)</span> 为允许集合参数的一阶集合论公式；本断言为关于该公式的归纳模式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mostowski\\text{-}induction} \\vdash \\Bigl[\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to P(y)))\\to P(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\forall x\\in A\\;P(x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mostowski\\text{-}induction} \\vdash \\Bigl[\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to P(y)))\\to P(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\forall x\\in A\\;P(x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mostowski induction is a principle for proving properties of well-founded structures.</li>\n<li>Equivalent to transfinite induction on the rank of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-wellfounded","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-wellfounded]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mostowski\\text{-}induction} \\vdash \\Bigl[\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to P(y)))\\to P(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\\forall x\\in A\\;P(x)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":861,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-mostowski-induction.md|58-thm-mostowski-induction]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["7308daa58e0345ed"]}